l models",on:!0},{t:"Parallel generations: up to 8 Videos, 8 Images",on:!0},{t:"Access to Supercomputer",hl:!0},{t:"Access to all features",on:!0},{t:"Early access to advanced AI features",on:!0},{t:"Lowest cost per credit",on:!0,tail:"55% CHEAPER",tt:"cheap"}],seedance:[{n:"Seedance 2.0",access:!0,unlim:!0},{n:"Seedance 2.0 Fast",access:!0,unlim:!0}],premiumModels:[{n:"Veo 3.1",unlim:!0,q:"1080p"},{n:"Kling 3.0",unlim:!0,q:"1080p"}],gens:[{n:"Seedream 4.5",on:!0,q:"4K",badge:"10,000 FREE GENS",bt:"free"},{n:"Flux Schnell",on:!0,badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"},{n:"Flux Pro",on:!0,badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"},{n:"Nano Banana",on:!0,badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"},{n:"Nano Banana 2",on:!0,q:"4K",badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"},{n:"GPT Image 2",on:!0,badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"},{n:"Imagen Premium",on:!0,badge:`${o} UNLIMITED`,bt:"unlim"}]}],S={pill:"This week only",line1:"Nano Banana Pro & GPT Image 2",line1Accent:"Unlimited",line2:"Seedance 2.0 Unlimited \u2014 included this week only",meta:"Get Nano Banana Pro, GPT Image 2 & Seedance 2.0 on any Unlimited plan for 7 days. No extra credits, no catch."},k=[{icon:"Sparkles",title:"4K Upscaling",blurb:"Turn any image or video into crisp, print-ready 4K. Restore detail, sharpen faces and remove noise in one pass.",tags:["Topaz","Magnific","Recraft HD"]},{icon:"Clapperboard",title:"Video Editing",blurb:"Trim, cut, restyle and extend clips. Auto-cut to the beat, add b-roll and export ready-to-post reels.",tags:["Seedance 2.0","Kling 3.0","Veo 3.1"]},{icon:"Wand2",title:"Image Editing",blurb:"Inpaint, swap backgrounds, expand the frame and restyle in a click \u2014 no Photoshop required.",tags:["Nano Banana 2","Flux Pro","GPT Image 2"]},{icon:"Boxes",title:"140+ AI Models",blurb:"Every frontier model for image, video, voice and music \u2014 under one membership, always up to date.",tags:["Image","Video","Audio"]},{icon:"AudioLines",title:"Voice & Music",blurb:"Studio-grade voiceovers, dubbing and original tracks. Clone a voice or score a scene in seconds.",tags:["ElevenLabs","Suno"]},{icon:"Smile",title:"Characters & Lipsync",blurb:"Consistent characters and Soul IDs across every shot, with frame-accurate lipsync in any language.",tags:["Soul IDs","Lipsync Studio"]}],L={title:"Enterprise AI infrastructure for teams that produce at scale",blurb:"Tailored workflows, dedicated support, seamless onboarding, full control at scale, and no training on your data.",pillars:[{icon:"ShieldCheck",title:"Security & Compliance",sub:"Your data is never used for model training. SOC 2 Type 2 in progress."},{icon:"Database",title:"Data & usage rights",sub:"You retain rights to every AI-generated output \u2014 no restrictions to use, edit or publish anywhere."},{icon:"Users",title:"SSO & admin control",sub:"Secure your team and stay in control \u2014 manage roles and permissions from one dashboard."}],extras:["Unlimited members","Custom credit amount","Dedicated model capacity","Access to all models on the platform","Volume-based discounts at the best rates","Priority queue for faster task processing"]},P=[{q:"How do credits work?",a:"Premium Credits power higher-cost tools and premium models \u2014 video, premium image, voice and music. Roughly one credit per image and a few per short video. Unlimited Daily Generations (everyday text/chat) never touch your credits. Credits refill every billing cycle."},{q:"Is my subscription automatically renewed?",a:"Yes. Plans renew automatically at the end of each cycle at the listed price. You can switch, downgrade or cancel anytime from your dashboard before renewal."},{q:"How many images or videos can I generate?",a:"It depends on your credit pool and which models you use \u2014 see the live estimates on each plan card (e.g. Nano Banana 2 generations and Kling 3.0 videos). Models marked \u221E Unlimited have no per-generation cost."},{q:"How does \u221E Unlimited work?",a:"On models marked \u221E Unlimited you can generate as much as you want with no credit cost, subject to fair-use limits to keep AIPU fast for everyone. SeeDance 2.0 unlimited is included on Pro and Agency plans."},{q:"Can I change my subscription after purchase?",a:"Absolutely. Upgrade, downgrade or cancel at any time. Upgrades take effect immediately; downgrades and cancellations apply at your next renewal."},{q:"Is there a money-back guarantee?",a:"Yes \u2014 every plan is backed by a 14-day no-questions-asked money-back guarantee. If it's not for you, email us within 14 days for a full refund."}],C=["Gemini 3.1 Pro","GPT-5.4","Kimi K2.5","Grok 4.1 Fast","DeepSeek V3.2"],E=[{quote:"I cancelled Midjourney, Runway and ElevenLabs and just use AIPU now. The Seedance and Kling access alone pays for itself.",name:"Maya R.",role:"Content Studio Owner",stars:5},{quote:"Unlimited daily chat across Gemini, GPT and Grok plus credits for video is exactly how I work. Scale is the sweet spot.",name:"Devon K.",role:"Marketing Lead",stars:5},{quote:"My team shares one Pro workspace \u2014 shared credits, analytics, SSO. Onboarding new creators takes about a minute.",name:"Priya N.",role:"Creative Agency Founder",stars:5},{quote:"New models show up almost weekly and they're just there in my plan. Best value in AI right now, full stop.",name:"Jordan T.",role:"Indie Filmmaker",stars:5}],M={intro:"AIPU gives you two powerful ways to create \u2014 unlimited everyday AI for daily work, and Premium Credits for premium production. Best of both worlds.",ways:[{title:"Unlimited Daily Generations",tone:"green",icon:"Infinity",blurb:"Your creative workspace for everyday AI. Create freely with supported text workflows \u2014 no credit counter for basic tasks.",items:["AI chat (Gemini 3.1 Pro, GPT-5.4, Grok 4.1)","Writing, blogs & emails","Scripts, sales & ad copy","Summaries & PDF analysis","Research & meeting notes","Rewriting & translations","Business docs & outlines"]},{title:"Premium Credits",tone:"gold",icon:"Zap",blurb:"Your monthly creation power for higher-cost tools, premium models and advanced media \u2014 with faster, more consistent processing.",items:["Video (Seedance, Kling, Veo)","Premium image (Nano Banana, Flux)","Voiceovers & podcasts (ElevenLabs)","Music (Suno)","Reels & UGC-style clips","Premium model outputs","Higher-quality / 4K upscales"]}],rule:{a:"Unlimited = everyday creation.",b:"Premium Credits = premium production."},faqs:[{q:"Is text AI unlimited?",a:"Yes. Supported text workflows on Gemini 3.1 Pro, GPT-5.4, Kimi K2.5, Grok 4.1 Fast and DeepSeek V3.2 \u2014 chat, writing, summaries, documents, PDFs, translations, rewriting, research, scripts and emails \u2014 are included with Unlimited Daily Generations."},{q:"Do images, videos, podcasts & voiceovers use credits?",a:"Yes. Premium media tools \u2014 Seedance, Kling, Veo, Nano Banana, Flux, GPT Image, ElevenLabs and Suno \u2014 use Premium Credits."},{q:"Are daily generations rate-limited?",a:"They're designed for normal daily use; most people never hit a limit. Speed may vary during high demand, and abnormal usage may be reviewed under Fair Use."},{q:"What if I use all my Premium Credits?",a:"Keep using Unlimited Daily Generations for everyday work. Premium tools resume with more credits, an upgrade, or your next billing cycle."}],fairUse:"Unlimited Daily Generations are for individual, human use. Automated, shared, resold or abusive usage may be slowed, limited, paused or reviewed to keep AIPU fast and stable for everyone."};Object.assign(window,{Icon:s,PLANS:w,TEXT_MODELS:C,TESTIMONIALS:E,UNLIMITED_INFO:M,ENTERPRISE:L,PLAN_FAQS:P,PROMO:S,CAPABILITIES:k});var{useState:N,useEffect:A}=React,y=e=>e.toLocaleString("en-US");function p({bt:e,children:t}){return React.createElement("span",{className:`bdg bdg-${e}`},t)}function g({label:e="Learn more"}){return React.createElement("button",{className:"learn",onClick:()=>window.dispatchEvent(new CustomEvent("aipu:openInfo"))},e)}function I(){return React.createElement("span",{className:"info-dot",onClic